# --- CRITICAL: live session credentials and generated artifacts ---
# `cookies-get` dumps *every* cookie for the domain, including
# __Secure-1PSID / __Secure-1PSCT session tokens. The next run would commit
# live Google credentials. Treat these files as secrets and never track them.
cookies.json
cookies-restore.json

